"Next Time: 'Friends and Love,
Love and Cherry Blossoms'"

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:01.080
"Next Time: 'Friends and Love,
Love and Cherry Blossoms'"

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:01.080
Adashimapedia: The final episode.

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:03.580
"Next Time: 'Friends and Love,
Love and Cherry Blossoms'"

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:03.580
--I've realized something insane.
--What's that?

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:06.910
If we never air the next episode,
the final episode will never come!

00:24:06.910 --> 00:24:09.910
Meaning this anime will never end!

00:24:09.910 --> 00:24:12.830
Pretty sure people will just think
it got canceled then.
